{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, squish, and slingshot through Gooey\u2019s physics-driven platforming challenges across eye-catching, momentum-based levels. After researching genre classics for inspiration, developer TurboOG Pixel went into their lab and mixed a beaker of tight controls with a solution of satisfying movement. True to SCIENCE, they even added a whole chemistry set for players in the form of a built-in level editor with robust Steam Workshop support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCHY ARM GRAPPLING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner five-year-old-who-just-spent-a-quarter-on-a-sticky-hand with Gooey\u2019s (PATENTED, PLEASE DO NOT STEAL) <i>Goopling </i>hook! Grab walls, swing from pulley belts, and slingshot across gaps. Perfect the timing of each goople to find the flow state and pursue flawless runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.poster.avif?t=1764731850\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.webm?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.mp4?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIPE LAUNCHERS &amp; MOVING BELTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the \u201cgo\u201d in \u201cGooey!\u201d Chain together wicked smooth platforming combos to fly in and out of zooming pipes and zip across spinning belts at breakneck speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.poster.avif?t=1764731850\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.webm?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.mp4?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAZARDS &amp; MOMENTUM CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not all bubbles and beakers. Narrowly dodge electric beams, harness built-up momentum to close gaps across bottomless pits, and do what it takes to survive more than 50 hand-crafted levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLES &amp; GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, Gooey\u2019s gotta get the heck out of the lab, but to do that, he\u2019s got to collect the L, A, and B letters scattered throughout each level before reaching the beacon. Show off Gooey\u2019s platforming prowess and claim those bragging rights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.poster.avif?t=1764731850\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.webm?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.mp4?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR + WORKSHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a mad scientist in your own home by creating, playing, and sharing custom levels with full Steam Workshop support. Dream up everything, from chill obstacle courses to races against the clock and <i>evil </i>precision gauntlets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speedrunner, casual goo-flinger, or aspiring level designer, Gooey offers a playground of sticky, satisfying movement and endless community creativity at your stretchy fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689150?t=1764731850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/45211a9804782c0b666212f9d66c66ce4f45c85a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764731850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/d518f4bd4b8e0b4c410f4dbc7d097420344fd4be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764731850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/d518f4bd4b8e0b4c410f4dbc7d097420344fd4be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764731850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, squish, and slingshot through Gooey\u2019s physics-driven platforming challenges across eye-catching, momentum-based levels. After researching genre classics for inspiration, developer TurboOG Pixel went into their lab and mixed a beaker of tight controls with a solution of satisfying movement. True to SCIENCE, they even added a whole chemistry set for players in the form of a built-in level editor with robust Steam Workshop support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCHY ARM GRAPPLING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner five-year-old-who-just-spent-a-quarter-on-a-sticky-hand with Gooey\u2019s (PATENTED, PLEASE DO NOT STEAL) <i>Goopling </i>hook! Grab walls, swing from pulley belts, and slingshot across gaps. Perfect the timing of each goople to find the flow state and pursue flawless runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.poster.avif?t=1764731850\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.webm?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b85f683f86780aa3339e8f17519be308.mp4?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIPE LAUNCHERS &amp; MOVING BELTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the \u201cgo\u201d in \u201cGooey!\u201d Chain together wicked smooth platforming combos to fly in and out of zooming pipes and zip across spinning belts at breakneck speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.poster.avif?t=1764731850\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.webm?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/b879e6e61789215e41a30d4cd1ce578f.mp4?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAZARDS &amp; MOMENTUM CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not all bubbles and beakers. Narrowly dodge electric beams, harness built-up momentum to close gaps across bottomless pits, and do what it takes to survive more than 50 hand-crafted levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLES &amp; GOALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, Gooey\u2019s gotta get the heck out of the lab, but to do that, he\u2019s got to collect the L, A, and B letters scattered throughout each level before reaching the beacon. Show off Gooey\u2019s platforming prowess and claim those bragging rights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.poster.avif?t=1764731850\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.webm?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/extras/5158096f5cb0da83d58ab8c3fe92b0c4.mp4?t=1764731850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR + WORKSHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a mad scientist in your own home by creating, playing, and sharing custom levels with full Steam Workshop support. Dream up everything, from chill obstacle courses to races against the clock and <i>evil </i>precision gauntlets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speedrunner, casual goo-flinger, or aspiring level designer, Gooey offers a playground of sticky, satisfying movement and endless community creativity at your stretchy fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Turbo Pixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Ra