am/apps/3689150/2b6806848e8b9b072f33aeb1c8e6de843fc71a74/ss_2b6806848e8b9b072f33aeb1c8e6de843fc71a74.600x338.jpg?t=1764731850"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/3684c7fa780fab087cd505f53923597c2131d3b4/ss_3684c7fa780fab087cd505f53923597c2131d3b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764731850","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/3684c7fa780fab087cd505f53923597c2131d3b4/ss_3684c7fa780fab087cd505f53923597c2131d3b4.600x338.jpg?t=1764731850"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/bea3ff928282c1fdc0527d7430086b251000ebe4/ss_bea3ff928282c1fdc0527d7430086b251000ebe4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764731850","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689150/bea3ff928282c1fdc0527d7430086b251000ebe4/ss_bea3ff928282c1fdc0527d7430086b251000ebe4.600x338.jpg?t=1764731850"}],"short_description":"SCIENCE HAS RUN AMUCK! Gooey has come to life! Escape a laboratory seemingly designed to thwart the newly created experiment\u2019s efforts. Sling Gooey\u2019s sticky lil\u2019 hand to grapple through hand-crafted challenges, or build and create levels of your own to share on Steam Workshop.","steam_appid":3689150,"support_info":{"email":"contact@ogpixelgames.com","url":"https://www.gooey.gg/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}